1
00:00:04,171 --> 00:00:07,236
Good morning! What can I get you?

2
00:00:07,966 --> 00:00:11,089
A coffee with milk, please.

3
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:15,317
For here or to go?

4
00:00:16,569 --> 00:00:20,093
To go. I'm in a bit of a hurry.

5
00:00:20,823 --> 00:00:23,258
Sure. Anything else?

6
00:00:24,248 --> 00:00:27,084
No, thanks. How much is it?

7
00:00:28,336 --> 00:00:31,401
That's two euros fifty.

8
00:00:32,131 --> 00:00:35,025
Can I pay by card?

9
00:00:36,015 --> 00:00:38,450
Yes, no problem.

10
00:00:39,701 --> 00:00:42,709
Lena! What are you doing here?

11
00:00:43,439 --> 00:00:46,218
Marco! What a coincidence.

12
00:00:47,209 --> 00:00:49,701
Have you moved in yet?

13
00:00:50,952 --> 00:00:54,190
Not yet. I'm still looking for a flat.

14
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:58,329
Really? And how is the search going?

15
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:02,271
So-so. Everything is really expensive.

16
00:01:03,522 --> 00:01:06,473
I know exactly what you mean.

17
00:01:07,203 --> 00:01:10,498
I have a viewing at eleven today.

18
00:01:11,488 --> 00:01:14,382
Do you want me to come with you?

19
00:01:15,633 --> 00:01:18,698
There's no need, but thanks.

20
00:01:19,428 --> 00:01:22,895
Hey, it's going to rain. Do you have an umbrella?

21
00:01:23,886 --> 00:01:26,779
No, I left it at home.

22
00:01:28,031 --> 00:01:30,695
Here, take mine.

23
00:01:31,425 --> 00:01:33,687
Are you sure?

24
00:01:34,678 --> 00:01:38,374
Absolutely. Give it back to me tonight.

25
00:01:39,626 --> 00:01:42,118
OK. I owe you one.

26
00:01:42,848 --> 00:01:46,888
Don't worry about it. Shall we have dinner at nine?

27
00:01:47,879 --> 00:01:50,313
That sounds great.

28
00:01:51,565 --> 00:01:54,344
Perfect. See you later!

29
00:01:55,073 --> 00:01:57,680
Here's your coffee.

30
00:01:58,671 --> 00:02:02,425
Thank you very much. Have a nice day!

31
00:02:10,975 --> 00:02:13,926
Excuse me, could you help me?

32
00:02:14,655 --> 00:02:16,918
Of course, go ahead.

33
00:02:17,909 --> 00:02:21,032
I'm looking for the train to the city centre.

34
00:02:22,283 --> 00:02:25,004
It leaves from platform four.

35
00:02:25,734 --> 00:02:28,800
What time does the next one leave?

36
00:02:29,790 --> 00:02:33,831
At quarter past ten, but it's running late today.

37
00:02:35,082 --> 00:02:38,205
Late? How long?

38
00:02:38,935 --> 00:02:42,287
About twenty minutes, more or less.

39
00:02:43,278 --> 00:02:46,573
Oh no. I have an appointment at eleven.

40
00:02:47,824 --> 00:02:51,463
Then you'd better take the bus.

41
00:02:52,193 --> 00:02:55,373
Is the stop far from here?

42
00:02:56,364 --> 00:02:59,716
No, it's a five-minute walk.

43
00:03:00,967 --> 00:03:05,347
Go out the main door and turn left.

44
00:03:06,077 --> 00:03:09,314
And which bus do I need to take?

45
00:03:10,305 --> 00:03:14,116
The thirty-two. It comes every ten minutes.

46
00:03:15,367 --> 00:03:19,236
Could you repeat that, please? More slowly.

47
00:03:19,966 --> 00:03:23,490
The thirty-two, every ten minutes.

48
00:03:24,481 --> 00:03:28,120
Perfect. Thank you very much for your help.

49
00:03:29,371 --> 00:03:32,035
You're welcome. Have a good trip!

50
00:03:32,765 --> 00:03:35,601
Mrs Ortiz? It's Lena.

51
00:03:36,592 --> 00:03:40,231
I'm sorry, I'm going to be a bit late.

52
00:03:41,482 --> 00:03:45,064
That's fine. I'll wait for you at the entrance.

53
00:03:45,794 --> 00:03:48,687
Thank you for your patience.

54
00:03:56,977 --> 00:04:00,099
Come in, come in. This is the living room.

55
00:04:01,351 --> 00:04:03,613
It's so bright!

56
00:04:04,343 --> 00:04:08,269
It faces south, so it gets sun all afternoon.

57
00:04:09,260 --> 00:04:12,325
How many bedrooms does it have?

58
00:04:13,576 --> 00:04:16,585
Two bedrooms and a bathroom.

59
00:04:17,315 --> 00:04:19,979
Can I see the kitchen?

60
00:04:20,969 --> 00:04:24,494
Of course. It has just been renovated.

61
00:04:25,745 --> 00:04:28,925
How much is the rent per month?

62
00:04:29,655 --> 00:04:33,179
Eight hundred euros, bills included.

63
00:04:34,170 --> 00:04:37,006
Does that include heating?

64
00:04:38,257 --> 00:04:41,380
Yes, the heating and the water.

65
00:04:42,110 --> 00:04:44,832
Is there a deposit?

66
00:04:45,822 --> 00:04:48,429
Two months' deposit.

67
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:52,344
Are pets allowed?

68
00:04:53,074 --> 00:04:56,197
It depends. What pet do you have?

69
00:04:57,188 --> 00:04:59,909
A very calm cat.

70
00:05:01,161 --> 00:05:03,939
A cat is no problem.

71
00:05:04,669 --> 00:05:07,677
When would it be available?

72
00:05:08,668 --> 00:05:11,332
From the first of the month.

73
00:05:12,583 --> 00:05:16,280
There's someone else interested, to be honest.

74
00:05:17,010 --> 00:05:19,961
I understand. Let me think about it.

75
00:05:20,951 --> 00:05:24,074
Of course. Will you let me know tomorrow?

76
00:05:25,325 --> 00:05:28,620
Yes, I'll write to you tomorrow without fail.

77
00:05:29,350 --> 00:05:32,358
Very good. Oh, look how it's raining!

78
00:05:33,349 --> 00:05:36,472
Good thing I have an umbrella.

79
00:05:45,022 --> 00:05:48,719
Good afternoon. How can I help you?

80
00:05:49,448 --> 00:05:52,342
I'm not feeling very well.

81
00:05:53,332 --> 00:05:55,538
What's wrong?

82
00:05:56,789 --> 00:06:00,600
My throat hurts and I'm very tired.

83
00:06:01,330 --> 00:06:03,593
Since when?

84
00:06:04,583 --> 00:06:07,420
Since last night.

85
00:06:08,671 --> 00:06:10,933
Do you have a fever?

86
00:06:11,663 --> 00:06:15,073
I don't think so, but I'm not sure.

87
00:06:16,064 --> 00:06:20,219
I recommend these throat lozenges.

88
00:06:21,470 --> 00:06:24,478
Take one every four hours.

89
00:06:25,208 --> 00:06:28,847
Can I take them on an empty stomach?

90
00:06:29,838 --> 00:06:32,617
Better after eating.

91
00:06:33,868 --> 00:06:36,360
And drink plenty of water.

92
00:06:37,090 --> 00:06:39,467
And if I don't get better?

93
00:06:40,458 --> 00:06:44,326
If you don't improve in three days, go to the doctor.

94
00:06:45,577 --> 00:06:48,643
All right. How much do I owe you?

95
00:06:49,373 --> 00:06:52,094
Six euros twenty.

96
00:06:53,085 --> 00:06:55,176
Here you are.

97
00:06:56,427 --> 00:06:58,690
Get well soon.

98
00:06:59,419 --> 00:07:02,026
Thank you, that's very kind.

99
00:07:10,316 --> 00:07:13,611
Finally! I thought you weren't coming.

100
00:07:14,862 --> 00:07:18,042
Sorry, I'm late again.

101
00:07:18,772 --> 00:07:22,124
Don't worry. I've just arrived.

102
00:07:23,115 --> 00:07:26,926
Here's your umbrella. It saved my life.

103
00:07:28,177 --> 00:07:30,727
How did the viewing go?

104
00:07:31,457 --> 00:07:34,580
Very well. I love the flat.

105
00:07:35,570 --> 00:07:37,775
And the price?

106
00:07:39,027 --> 00:07:42,322
A bit expensive, but it's worth it.

107
00:07:43,052 --> 00:07:45,544
Are you going to take it?

108
00:07:46,534 --> 00:07:50,403
I think so. I'll write to the owner tomorrow.

109
00:07:51,654 --> 00:07:55,006
Congratulations! We have to celebrate.

110
00:07:55,736 --> 00:07:58,171
What will you have?

111
00:07:59,161 --> 00:08:01,768
What do you recommend?

112
00:08:03,019 --> 00:08:06,142
The paella is very good today.

113
00:08:06,872 --> 00:08:09,938
Then two paellas, please.

114
00:08:10,928 --> 00:08:14,109
And a bottle of still water.

115
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:17,393
Right away.

116
00:08:18,123 --> 00:08:21,590
Hey, are you OK? You don't look well.

117
00:08:22,581 --> 00:08:25,990
I've got a bit of a cold, that's all.

118
00:08:27,242 --> 00:08:30,881
You should rest this weekend.

119
00:08:31,611 --> 00:08:35,651
You're right. But I have a thousand things to do.

120
00:08:36,642 --> 00:08:39,994
Shall I give you a hand with the move?

121
00:08:41,245 --> 00:08:44,368
Really? That would be great.

122
00:08:45,098 --> 00:08:48,450
Of course. That's what friends are for.

123
00:08:49,441 --> 00:08:52,162
I owe you one, again.

124
00:08:53,414 --> 00:08:56,766
You owe me two. But who's counting?

125
00:08:57,496 --> 00:09:00,504
What do you mean by that?

126
00:09:01,495 --> 00:09:04,847
That you buy me the next dinner.

127
00:09:06,098 --> 00:09:08,246
It's a deal.

128
00:09:08,976 --> 00:09:12,042
Here you are. Enjoy your meal!

129
00:09:13,032 --> 00:09:15,467
That looks delicious!

130
00:09:16,718 --> 00:09:19,210
To the new flat.

131
00:09:19,940 --> 00:09:21,801
Cheers!

132
00:09:22,792 --> 00:09:25,915
By the way, is it still raining?

133
00:09:27,166 --> 00:09:29,257
It's pouring.

134
00:09:29,987 --> 00:09:33,855
Then you're lending me the umbrella again.

135
00:09:34,846 --> 00:09:38,542
No way. This time I'll walk you home.

136
00:09:39,793 --> 00:09:41,941
You're a sweetheart.
